2026-09-02T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2182) '## name: rfd-2182-identity-triangle-operator-market-customer description: When writing about who runs the atelier-workshop, who receives the shuttle, or which market the workspace competes in, use these three anchors. Operator is chibifire.com (K. S. Ernest (iFire) Lee). Partner project is V-Sekai (iFire is a V-Sekai co-founder per the 2020-06-08 charter). Market is avatar-first social VR. Never name third-party social-VR trademarks; use generic vocabulary per CLAUDE.md. tools: Read, Write, Edit
 # tags: rfd:details-preamble
 Text:RFD2182  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2182) 'chibifire.com runs the atelier-workshop (the pipeline), V-Sekai is its co-founded partner project that receives the shuttle (the portable-character deliverable), and the market is avatar-first social VR.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2182  1 LINE
 Text:Written

