2026-09-02T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2182) '- Operator: `chibifire.com` (K. S. Ernest (iFire) Lee, github.com/fire). Owns the atelier-workshop; ships the shuttle.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2182  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2182) '- Partner project: V-Sekai (charter at `V-Sekai/manuals-vsk/decisions/20200608-vsekai-charter.md`). iFire is a founding team member; the shuttle enters V-Sekai because both projects share the same intent: open, self-hosted, remixable social VR.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2182  1 LINE
 Text:Written

